# Normalise text to LF in the repository, whatever the checkout's setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Things that are not text: without this, a diff of a PNG reads as garbage and
# a checkout on Windows would try to rewrite line endings inside a font.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.exe  binary
*.vhd  binary
*.vhdx binary

# The reference baseline is a verbatim copy of another project (PROVENANCE.md
# section 3). It is not ours to normalise: leaving it byte-identical is the
# only thing that makes "diff against upstream" mean anything.
docs/reference/** -text
